BANO KA THA NOUHA ALI ASGHAR KI LAHAD PAR<br>
 KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR ,<br>
 KIS TARHA MADINE KO MAIN JAOON MERE DILBAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
BABA BHI HUME CHOD KE MAQTAL KO SIDHARE WAPAS NAHIN AAYE,<br>
 AUR TUM BHI CHALE CHOD KE MAA KO SUE KOUSAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
HAYE KHOON MAIN TAR CHAND SA RUQSAR HUA HAIN KYA ZULM HUWA HAI,<br>
 WO NANNI SI GARDAN PE CHALA TEERE SITAMGAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
QATIL TERA KYA SAHIBE AULAAD NAHIN THA YE BHI NAHIN SOCHA,<br>
 MAREGA TUMHE TEEER TOH MARJAYEGI MAADAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
AYE LAAL TERI SAAL GIRA BHI NA RACHAYI MANNAT NA BADHAYI <br>
YE NANNE SHALOKE KISE PEHNAOO MAIN DILBAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
AMMA KO GAYE CHOOD KE TUM KISKE SAHARE BOLO MERE PYAARE ,<br>
 YEH BHI NAHIN SOCHA KE NA JEE PAYEGI MAADAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
AB DOON KISE LORI KISE JHOOLE MAIN JHULAOON KISKO MAIN SULAOON,<br>
 YAAD ATA HAI AAGOSH MAIN ANA WO HUMAK KAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
EK PAL KO MERA SAAT JO TUM PAATE NAHIN THE GHABRATE THE DARKE,<br>
 ARAAM SE AB LEYT GAYE QABAR KE ANDAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
SUGHRA TUMHEIN PUCHEGI TOH MAIN USKO KAHOON KYA BATLAOO KHUDARA ,<br>
 KISTARHA WO JEE PAYEGI BOLO ALI ASGHAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR<br>
<br>
JIS WAQT CHALA KARWAAN YE KARBO BALA SE THE MAA KE YEH NAALE ,<br>
 CHILLATI THI AYE MOOSAVI RORO KE YE MAADAR KYA SOGAYE ASGHAR..